      "id": 2,
      "claim": "The outcome being measured is the November electric bill (compared to October).",
      "evidence": "Problem states each student compares their October bill to the one they would receive for November.",
      "weight": 0.15,
      "depends_on": [1]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "claim": "The list of energy‑saving tips is chosen and followed by the students, so it is a controlled variable.",
      "evidence": "The problem says each student would have a list of tips that they would follow during November.",
